      "writtenOn": "2025-10-06T13:17:58Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e Anyway, it seems the cleanest solution would be to let range_has_pvmfw() itself return the overlapped range and the pvmfw offset.\n\nDone.",
      "parentUuid": "fd650d95_715a1c35",
      "revId": "df73329d09c37d048afaf19e48bae1d52cc86fe1",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
